        "created_at": "2016-02-22T22:08:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just lost my second Mint One Shot because of Steam Sync. &nbsp;This is becoming increadibly disheartening.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Has anyone else had this issue?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I want to like One Shots and I do like the challenge, but I everytime I miss a mint, especially to a bug, it makes me want to uninstall it a little more.</p>",
