        "id": 163418,
        "name": "erikoverton",
        "username": "erikoverton",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-22T23:17:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks MigrantP. I know this isn't on your end. &nbsp;I was womdering if others were having similar issues. I will try steam to try and stop this from happening again, But I know Steam will not be able to help me retrieve my mint.</p><p><span>The first time I lost a mint I pretty sure it was my fault. &nbsp;I did not pay enough attention when the steam cloud error came up. &nbsp;This time I was careful. &nbsp;The first thing I did when I launched the game was check my mints. &nbsp;When I saw it wasn't there, I closed and noticed steam sync. &nbsp;When it was done, I pulled my laptop out. &nbsp;Steam had issues connecting, whne it finally did, I saw sentinels update on my laptop before I had chance to open it there. &nbsp;Steam gave me no warning.</span></p><p><span>It'd be nice if I could fix this with a patch, but I understand that might cheapen the xperience for others.</span></p><p>Any chance Handelabra might offer chances to remint? &nbsp;Maybe on SOTM TVG's anniverseries?</p>",
