        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/emcg575797/{size}/2440_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-24T09:50:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"erikoverton\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/4491bb/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> erikoverton:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I just lost my second Mint One Shot because of Steam Sync. &nbsp;This is becoming increadibly disheartening.&nbsp;Has anyone else had this issue?&nbsp;I want to like One Shots and I do like the challenge, but I everytime I miss a mint, especially to a bug, it makes me want to uninstall it a little more.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I had an issue with my ipad 2 which would drop me out of a game after about an hour, and on the weekly one shots I wouldn't get the option to continue game. Lost a couple of Mints that way.</p>\n<p>I ended up buying a new ipad. Doesn't help you, I know, but I do feel your pain.</p>",
